    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><b>Manufactured By:</b> The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bothan\" title=\"Bothan\">Bothan</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a>) </p><p><b>Applicable To:</b> Any Weapon with an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ion\">Ion</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stun\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stun\">Stun</a> Setting </p><p><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bothan\" title=\"Bothan\">Bothan</a> society is well known for its penchant for espionage, and the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bothan\" title=\"Bothan\">Bothans</a> have developed methods of subduing targets without killing them. </p><p><b>Weapons:</b> Bothan Manufacture Weapons deal +1 die of damage when set to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stun\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stun\">Stun</a> or when dealing <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ion\">Ion</a> damage, but deal -1 die of damage when not set to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Stun\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stun\">Stun</a> or dealing <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ion\">Ion</a> damage. </p>",
